OL,3,AGovernment backs welfare shake-up to
OL,4,Aprevent 'lost generation'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has backed plans by
OL,7,Fformer minister Alan Milburn for
OL,8,Fsweeping reforms to prevent "losing a
OL,9,Fgeneration" of young people to a life
OL,10,Fon benefits.
OL,12,FMilburn proposes spending billions on
OL,13,Ftailored support for under 25s not in
OL,14,Femployment, education or training
OL,15,F(Neets), to be part-funded by cuts to
OL,16,Fsome benefits.
OL,18,FHe claims his plan, which also proposes
OL,19,Ftax breaks for firms and major
OL,20,Feducation reforms, will get 440,000
OL,21,Fyoung people into jobs by 2036.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
