OL,3,AAmerican soldier arrested by UK police
OL,4,Aon suspicion of spying taken into US
OL,5,Amilitary custody
OL,6,
OL,7,FTyner was based at Imjin Barracks in
OL,8,FInnsworth, Gloucestershire, the
OL,9,Fheadquarters of Nato's Allied Rapid
OL,10,FReaction Corps.
OL,12,FCounter Terrorism Policing said he is
OL,13,Fnow in US custody over suspected
OL,14,Fnational security and espionage
OL,15,Fallegations. At the time of his arrest,
OL,16,FRussia said it had "nothing to do with
OL,17,Fit".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
