OL,3,ABurnham to set out options next month
OL,4,Afor long-term EU relationship
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has said he plans to set
OL,7,Fout his proposed options to reshape the
OL,8,FUK's future relationship with the EU
OL,9,Fnext month.
OL,11,FDowning Street had been facing pressure
OL,12,Fto specify when the prime minister
OL,13,Fwould take this step, after he
OL,14,Fpreviously said he would do so "around"
OL,15,Fa summit taking place in Brussels this
OL,16,Fweek.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
