OL,3,ANvidia says it won't reinstate Huang as
OL,4,Afirm reports bumper results
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier on Tuesday, Huang said he would
OL,7,Fbe "honoured" to return and lead
OL,8,FNvidia, having quit following alleged
OL,9,Fextramarital affairs, including one
OL,10,Fwith a suspected spy for China.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
